sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Reader as Reader / User
    participant UI as React UI (Page/Component)
    participant API as ResourceController
    participant SVC as ResourceService
    participant DB as Relational Database

    %% Search Flow
    Note over Reader, DB: 1. Search & Browse Flow
    Reader->>UI: Enter keyword & Submit
    UI->>API: GET /resources?q={keyword}
    API->>SVC: getResources(keyword)
    SVC->>DB: SELECT * FROM Resource WHERE title/author LIKE %keyword%
    DB-->>SVC: List<Resource>
    SVC-->>API: SearchResultDTO
    API-->>UI: 200 OK { items: [...] }
    UI-->>Reader: Render Resource Cards (or Empty State)

    %% Detail & Availability Flow
    Note over Reader, DB: 2. Resource Detail & Availability Flow
    Reader->>UI: Click Resource Card (Select ID)
    UI->>API: GET /resources/{id}
    API->>SVC: getResourceById(id)
    SVC->>DB: SELECT Resource, PhysicalItems, DigitalItem WHERE id = :id
    DB-->>SVC: Entity Records
    SVC->>SVC: Aggregate physical total/available & digital availability
    SVC-->>API: ResourceDetailDTO
    API-->>UI: 200 OK { id, title, accessTypes, physical, digital }
    UI-->>Reader: Render Detail Page & Availability Section
